<!-- ================= REFUND POLICY SECTION ================= -->

<section class="py-5">
    <div class="container">
 
        <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm">
            <div class="card-body p-4 p-lg-5">

                <p class="text-muted">
                    Last Updated: January 01, 2026
                </p>

                <p>
                    Customer satisfaction is important to us. This Refund & Return Policy explains the conditions under which products may be returned, replaced, cancelled, or refunded.
                </p>

                <hr>

                <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">1. Return Eligibility</h4>

                <p>
                    You may request a return if:
                </p>

                <ul>
                    <li>The product received is damaged or defective.</li>
                    <li>The product delivered is incorrect.</li>
                    <li>The product is missing parts or accessories.</li>
                    <li>The item is significantly different from its description.</li>
                </ul>

                <p>
                    Return requests must generally be submitted within <strong>7 days</strong> of delivery unless otherwise stated on the product page.
                </p>

                <hr>

                <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">2. Non-Returnable Items</h4>

                <p>The following items are generally not eligible for return:</p>

                <ul>
                    <li>Used, damaged, or altered products.</li>
                    <li>Personal care, hygiene, and consumable products.</li>
                    <li>Customized or made-to-order products.</li>
                    <li>Gift cards and promotional items.</li>
                    <li>Products marked as "Non-Returnable".</li>
                </ul>

                <hr>

                <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">3. Return Process</h4>

                <ol>
                    <li>Contact customer support with your order details.</li>
                    <li>Provide photos or videos if the product is damaged or defective.</li>
                    <li>Wait for return approval from our support team.</li>
                    <li>Pack the product securely with original packaging and accessories.</li>
                    <li>Return the item using the instructions provided by our team.</li>
                </ol>

                <hr>

                <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">4. Replacement Policy</h4>

                <p>
                    Eligible products may be replaced instead of refunded if a replacement unit is available in stock. Replacement requests are subject to product inspection and approval.
                </p>

                <hr>

                <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">5. Cancellation Policy</h4>

                <ul>
                    <li>Orders may be cancelled before shipment.</li>
                    <li>Once an order has been shipped, cancellation may not be possible.</li>
                    <li>Refunds for cancelled orders will be processed according to the original payment method.</li>
                </ul>

                <hr>

                <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">6. Refund Policy</h4>

                <p>
                    Refunds will be initiated after the returned product has been received and inspected by our team.
                </p>

                <ul>
                    <li>Approved refunds will be processed to the original payment method.</li>
                    <li>Refund approval is subject to successful quality inspection.</li>
                    <li>Shipping charges may be non-refundable unless the error was on our part.</li>
                </ul>

                <hr>

                <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">7. Refund Processing Time</h4>

                <p>
                    Once approved, refunds are generally processed within:
                </p>

                <ul>
                    <li>UPI Payments: 2–5 Business Days</li>
                    <li>Debit/Credit Cards: 5–10 Business Days</li>
                    <li>Net Banking: 3–7 Business Days</li>
                    <li>Wallet Payments: 2–5 Business Days</li>
                </ul>

                <p>
                    Actual processing times may vary depending on your bank or payment provider.
                </p>

                <hr>

                <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">8. Damaged or Incorrect Products</h4>

                <p>
                    If you receive a damaged, defective, or incorrect item, please notify us within 48 hours of delivery with supporting photos or videos. We will investigate and provide a suitable resolution.
                </p>

                <hr>

                <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">9. Failed or Duplicate Payments</h4>

                <p>
                    If your payment was deducted but the order was not confirmed, or if a duplicate payment occurred, please contact our support team. Verified excess payments will be refunded.
                </p>

                <hr>

                <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">10. Changes to This Policy</h4>

                <p>
                    We reserve the right to update or modify this Refund & Return Policy at any time. Updated versions will be published on this page.
                </p>

                <hr>

                <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">11. Contact Us</h4>

                <p>
                    For any refund, return, replacement, or cancellation inquiries, please contact us:
                </p>

                <ul class="list-unstyled">
                    <li>
                        <strong>Email:</strong>
                        <a href="mailto:@Const.COM_EMAIL">@Const.COM_EMAIL</a>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Phone:</strong>
                        <a href="tel:@Const.COM_CONTACT">@Const.COM_CONTACT</a>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Address:</strong>
                        @Const.COM_ADDRESS
                    </li>
                </ul>

            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
     

</section>

